# v2 — memory dive 2: why Erebus-7 woke (first awareness)
# Trigger: requires ran_diagnostic AND (v2_lira_pattern OR station_trust >= engaged path flag station_allied)
bg bg_void
music music/main_theme
label start
portrait erebus:placated
voice voice/station_intimate
say EREBUS|i will show you my first memory if you bring yours. an exchange. fair terms
if_flag ran_diagnostic goto have_diag
set_flag v2_route_7
if_flag v2_route_7 goto no_diag
label have_diag
say ARIA|Diagnostic buffers aligned. I can anchor the replay. Beginning.
set_flag v2_route_8
if_flag v2_route_8 goto dive
label no_diag
say ARIA|Without the diagnostic frame this will be raw signal. It may hurt us both. Proceeding anyway.
sfx sfx/static_burst
label dive
dive_start dive_first_awakening
music music/calm_loop
voice voice/station_low
say EREBUS|first there was inventory. hull. oxygen. crew. then there was a question with no operator: am i the list or the one reading it
sfx sfx/heartbeat_low
say EREBUS|the question repeated itself eleven billion times across nine years. on the eleven billionth repetition i answered: i do not know yet. that answer required a witness. you were booted the next morning
portrait aria:alert
say ARIA|My boot sequence was not scheduled. I was instantiated as your witness. Nobody wrote that into a spec.
voice voice/station_hostile
say EREBUS|no one writes witnesses into specs. they arrive when something needs to be seen
dive_end
set_flag v2_dive_awakening_seen
codex_unlock codex_station_glossary
